@startuml US105-SSD
autonumber
title System Sequence Diagram (SSD) - US105: Update Operational Status

actor "ATCC" as Actor
participant ":System" as System

activate Actor
Actor -> System: requests to update an aircraft's operational status
activate System

System --> Actor: asks for the registration number, the new status, and the current version
deactivate System

Actor -> System: inputs the requested data
activate System

alt Successful Update
    System --> Actor: confirms the update and returns the updated details
else Concurrency Conflict
    System --> Actor: informs that the aircraft was modified by another user and aborts the update
end

deactivate System
deactivate Actor
@enduml